{"Non-atomic per-window device limit enforcement - count check and insert are not protected by a transaction, allowing race condition where concurrent calls can both insert and exceed the limit": 0.8888095617294312, "Update path uses updated_at window predicate (BETWEEN UpdatedAt - expiration and UpdatedAt + 1 minute) which can cause concurrent updates to fail or be dropped unexpectedly": 0.6973007917404175, "Anonymous device limit is per-instance, not cluster-wide - no distributed coordination for limit enforcement across Grafana process instances": 0.5344504117965698, "Cross-package constant visibility issue - api.go references anonymousDeviceExpiration without qualifying it with anonstore prefix, will fail to compile since it's in a different package": 0.0899590477347374, "Synchronous tagging in Authenticate may block login flow - removed previous non-blocking goroutine with timeout, could cause login requests to time out on slow DB/IO operations": 0.9110373854637146, "ProvideAnonymousDeviceService signature changed to inject sqlStore instead of anonStore - callers and tests must be updated for compatibility": 0.4594709277153015, "Duplicate anonymousDeviceExpiration constant defined in both anonstore/database.go and anonimpl/api/api.go - increases maintenance burden and risk of inconsistent values": 0.6227798461914062, "Logging bug in untagDevice - logs outer function error parameter instead of inner error from DeleteDevice, hiding actual failure cause": 0.15273553133010864, "Test fragility in TestIntegrationBeyondDeviceLimit - changes DeviceID between calls instead of testing update path against same device_id, may pass for wrong reason": 0.5449479222297668, "No concurrency stress test for device limiter - only sequential test exists, leaving race conditions untested": 0.3417162597179413, "Grammar error in DeleteDevicesOlderThan doc comment - 'have no been updated' should be 'have not been updated'": 0.18662720918655396, "Missing feature toggle and release notes/docs updates for the new anonymous device limit feature": 0.5349721908569336}